      "type": "our-mission__longevity",
      "settings": {
        "title": "<span class=\"ambit-black-text\">Providing</span> <span class=\"romie-regular-italic-text\">Personal Longevity</span>",
        "title_font_size": 60,
        "description": "Youth &amp; Earth explores the idea of longevity for the consumer\nat every life stage. In a world that stigmatises and stereotypes\nageing, Youth &amp; Earth rewrites the narrative to focus on the\npower of potential at every age, through innovative products and\nhigh-impact ingredients for earned credibility.",
